eight family. No optimality for other weights or outside that range is claimed. The established two-denominator estimate and majorization method are credited, especially Kumar–Ravichandran (2017); priority is unestablished.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Separate adversarial AI audit: PASS_COMPLETE_SUFFICIENT_CONDITION, no correction\n- 50,840 author assertions replay byte-identically\n- 28,722 independent exact checks pass\n- Complete frozen proof and independent audit included\n- One substantive proof approach; recommended queue status claimed_solved, 1/5, pending parent update\n\nThis is a sufficient-condition answer to the literal request, not a necessary-and-sufficient coefficient characterization. No human peer-review or novelty claim. Leave this PR open in draft state.\n","created_at":"2026-09-30T11:00:35Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T11:07:51Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"b4d1dfcd2cf726d6c73257402f846333d0d24a95","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlecKriebel/Math/pulls/134/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlecKriebel/Math/pulls/134/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlecKriebel/Math/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlecKriebel/Math/issues/134/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlecKriebel/Math/statuses/6a865c574586d08e6fa185b09ebe746122457ff0","head":{"label":"AlecKriebel:dot/math-2306064","ref":"dot/math-2306064","sha":"6a865c574586d08e6fa185b09ebe746122457ff0","user":{"login":"AlecKriebel","id":6109370,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMDkzNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6109370?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel","html_url":"https://github.com/AlecKriebel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/A